# Newline-separated Go regexes of paths TruffleHog skips (passed via --exclude-paths).
# Local build and tool artifacts only -- no first-party source belongs here.
#
# These exist in a developer working tree but not in CI's fresh checkout, so
# excluding them makes `make security-trufflehog` agree with the CI scan instead
# of drowning it in findings from vendored dependencies and cached test IDs.
(^|/)\.git/
(^|/)\.venv/
(^|/)\.pytest_cache/
(^|/)\.ruff_cache/
(^|/)__pycache__/
(^|/)htmlcov/
(^|/)dist/
(^|/)node_modules/
(^|/)\.terraform/
(^|/)junit\.xml$
